## 3. Detailed Industry Workflows, Roles & Real-World Examples

---

### 3.1 Software & IT Company Vertical (`software_it`)
**Demonstration Tenant**: ABC Technologies Pvt. Ltd. (`abctechnologies.com`)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Prospect as Inbound SaaS Lead
    participant AI as AI Sales Agent
    participant AE as Sales Executive
    participant SM as Sales Manager
    participant Appt as AI Appointment Agent
    participant Supp as Support Operations

    Prospect->>AI: Submits demo request via website chat
    AI->>AI: Qualifies budget ($25k+), team size (75 seats), timeline (30 days)
    AI->>Appt: Initiates slot scheduling
    Appt->>Prospect: Offers available 45-min Zoom demo slots
    Prospect->>Appt: Selects Thursday 3:00 PM IST
    Appt->>AE: Creates Google Meet invite & calendar sync
    AE->>Prospect: Conducts live product demonstration
    AE->>SM: Submits custom enterprise quotation with 15% discount
    SM->>AE: Approves discount override
    AE->>Prospect: Sends proposal & digital contract
    Prospect->>AE: Signs contract & pays subscription invoice (Deal Won)
    AE->>Supp: Hands off client to Support Hub for onboarding & API integration
```

#### Roles, Responsibilities & Actions:
1. **Sales Manager**:
   - *Actions*: Sets quarterly pipeline targets, configures lead auto-assignment (round-robin / lead score weighted), reviews and signs off on quotation discount requests exceeding 10%, reviews team win/loss analytics.
2. **Sales Executive**:
   - *Actions*: Works the **Sales Executive Hub**, moves prospects through the 5-step lead-to-sale pipeline (Discovery $\rightarrow$ Demo $\rightarrow$ Proposal $\rightarrow$ Negotiation $\rightarrow$ Closed Won), runs interactive product demos (HRMS Pro, Cloud ERP), creates customized price proposals.
3. **Customer Support Manager**:
   - *Actions*: Monitors the **Support Operations Hub**, tracks team SLA adherence (30-minute first response, 4-hour resolution), triages high-severity tickets (Severity 1: System Down), reassigns unassigned tickets.
4. **Customer Support Agent**:
   - *Actions*: Operates the omnichannel support inbox, reviews AI-suggested responses, converts customer complaints into Jira/Dev bug items, creates knowledge base troubleshooting articles.
5. **Marketing Manager**:
   - *Actions*: Creates digital marketing campaigns (LinkedIn Inbound, Google Search Ads), generates campaign UTM tracking links, measures conversion attribution from lead to paid customer, manages email nurture sequences.
6. **BI Analyst / Viewer**:
   - *Actions*: Evaluates enterprise sales velocity, monitors customer churn rates, tracks product demand trends, exports business telemetry data to CSV.
7. **Autonomous AI Agents**:
   - *AI Sales Agent*: Answers prospect questions, collects BANT qualification criteria (Budget, Authority, Need, Timeline).
   - *AI Appointment Agent*: Coordinates calendar slots across multiple time zones, prevents double-booking, sends meeting reminder emails.
   - *AI Follow-up Agent*: Executes multi-touch nurture sequences (Day 2 check-in, Day 5 case study, Day 10 pricing reminder), automatically pauses when customer replies.

#### Real-World Case Study Example:
> **Scenario: Enterprise Cloud ERP Deal for Nexus Corporation (120 Seats)**
> 1. *Lead Ingestion*: Sarah Jenkins, VP of Operations at Nexus Corp, visits ABC Technologies' website at 11:30 PM and asks if the Cloud ERP integrates with SAP.
> 2. *AI Qualification*: The **AI Sales Agent** responds immediately, confirming the native SAP REST connector, asks about their current setup, and determines they have 120 users and a target rollout date next quarter.
> 3. *Appointment Booking*: The **AI Appointment Agent** offers Sarah three calendar slots for a custom demo. Sarah selects Thursday at 2:00 PM. An invite is generated with a Zoom link.
> 4. *Sales Executive Execution*: Sales Executive *Vikram Singh* opens the **Sales Executive Hub**, reviews Sarah's pre-qualified notes, and conducts the interactive demo showcasing the SAP connector.
> 5. *Quotation & Approval*: Vikram drafts a proposal for ₹18,00,000/year with a 15% multi-year discount. He clicks **Submit for Discount Approval**. Sales Manager *Priya Sharma* receives the alert in her dashboard and approves the discount.
> 6. *Closing & Handoff*: Sarah signs the digital agreement. Vikram clicks **Mark as Closed-Won**. The system automatically triggers an onboarding project in the **Support Operations Hub**, assigning support engineer *Amit Patel* to guide Nexus Corp through data migration.

