### 3.3 Education & Training Vertical (`education`)
**Demonstration Tenant**: Zenith Global Academy (`zenithacademy.edu`)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Applicant as Prospective Student / Parent
    participant AIAdm as AI Admissions Concierge
    participant Exec as Admissions Executive
    participant Couns as Career Counsellor
    participant Mgr as Admissions Manager
    participant Supp as Student Support Desk

    Applicant->>AIAdm: Inquires regarding Generative AI Masterclass
    AIAdm->>AIAdm: Checks educational qualification, work experience & timeline
    AIAdm->>Exec: Creates lead with 88% aptitude match score
    Exec->>Applicant: Conducts discovery call & books counsellor evaluation
    Couns->>Applicant: Administers technical assessment & recommends track
    Applicant->>Mgr: Submits merit-based scholarship fee reduction application
    Mgr->>Applicant: Approves 20% scholarship & issues batch enrollment invoice
    Applicant->>Applicant: Pays course fee
    Mgr->>Supp: Triggers automated LMS portal access & mentor allocation
```

#### Roles, Responsibilities & Actions:
1. **Admissions Manager**:
   - *Actions*: Configures course catalogs, batch capacities, and intake dates; approves early-bird discounts and merit scholarships; tracks inquiry-to-enrollment conversion rates.
2. **Admissions Executive**:
   - *Actions*: Handles inbound student inquiries, executes outbound consultation queues, answers syllabus questions, guides applicants through application form submissions.
3. **Career Counsellor**:
   - *Actions*: Conducts 1-on-1 profile discovery sessions, evaluates student career goals and technical aptitude, recommends optimal study tracks (e.g., Data Engineering vs. Full-Stack AI).
4. **Student Support Desk**:
   - *Actions*: Manages student portal access credentials, processes batch transfer or deferral requests, issues course completion certificates and academic transcripts.
5. **Autonomous AI Agents**:
   - *AI Admissions Concierge*: Screens candidates 24/7, answers questions regarding course duration, fee structure, placement assistance records, and schedules counselling appointments.

#### Real-World Case Study Example:
> **Scenario: Career Transition into Cloud AI Architecture**
> 1. *Website Chat*: Software developer *Anand Joshi* asks the website chatbot whether working professionals can attend the Weekend Cloud AI Cohort.
> 2. *AI Pre-Screening*: The **AI Admissions Concierge** verifies Anand's 3 years of Java experience, explains the weekend schedule (Saturday & Sunday 10 AM - 1 PM), and offers a syllabus download.
> 3. *Counselling Session*: Admissions Executive *Meera Sen* schedules an online video evaluation with Senior Career Counsellor *Dr. Aris Thorne*.
> 4. *Aptitude Review*: Dr. Thorne assesses Anand's background and recommends the Advanced Architect specialization track.
> 5. *Scholarship Approval*: Anand applies for the Women-in-Tech & Tech-Transition scholarship. Admissions Manager *Rajesh Gupta* reviews the profile and approves a ₹15,000 fee waiver.
> 6. *Enrollment & Onboarding*: Anand pays the remaining fee online. The student support desk provisions his GitHub Classroom, AWS sandbox environment, and Discord community access.

