## 4. Cross-Departmental Human-to-AI Handoff Protocols

To ensure safety, compliance, and superior customer experience across all 9 industries, Zenelait AI CRM utilizes an automated **Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) Handoff Protocol**.

```
┌───────────────────────────┐         Trigger Condition Met         ┌──────────────────────────┐
│   Autonomous AI Agent     │ ────────────────────────────────────► │    Human Staff Desk      │
│  • Answers FAQs           │  (e.g., High Sentiment Distress,      │  • Omnichannel Inbox     │
│  • Gathers Requirements   │   High Deal Value, Clinical Keyword,  │  • Full Chat History     │
│  • Books Available Slots  │   Discount Request > 15%)             │  • Takes Over Control    │
└───────────────────────────┘                                       └──────────────────────────┘
```

### 4.1 Handoff Trigger Conditions
1. **Negative Sentiment Detection**: When a customer displays high frustration or uses trigger words (e.g., *"unacceptable"*, *"cancel my service"*, *"fraud"*), the AI immediately silences automated responses and transfers the conversation to a Senior Support Manager.
2. **High Deal Value Threshold**: In Software, B2B Manufacturing, and Consulting verticals, any lead with an indicated transaction value exceeding ₹10,00,000 ($12,000+) is automatically tagged `HIGH_PRIORITY_ESCALATION` and assigned to a Human Sales Executive within 60 seconds.
3. **Medical Safety Guardrails**: In the Healthcare vertical, if a patient mentions acute emergency indicators (e.g., *"severe chest pain"*, *"loss of consciousness"*, *"difficulty breathing"*), the AI stops automated intake, displays the emergency ambulance hotline (108 / 911), and alerts the Hospital Reception Desk.
4. **Discount Negotiation Ceiling**: AI agents are strictly prohibited from granting discounts above pre-set limits (typically 5%). Any customer request for larger fee reductions triggers an approval workflow in the Manager's dashboard.

### 4.2 Seamless Context Preservation
When an AI-to-human handoff occurs:
- The human team member receives the full unedited chat transcript.
- A 3-bullet AI-generated executive summary appears at the top of the conversation view.
- The customer is notified: *"I am connecting you with our senior specialist, who is reviewing your details now."*
- The human agent can respond directly via WhatsApp, SMS, or Email from the unified inbox.

